# Licensing

- The audio thread may only load `LicenseManager::allowsProcessing()`. No `juce::URL`, no `PropertiesFile`, no lock.
- `requestActivation()` returns false on the audio thread. Network and disk run on `juce::Thread`.
- A cached token is valid for 14 days offline (`evaluateLicense`). No token fails closed.
- Webhooks verify the signature on the raw body, compare in constant time, and are idempotent on the provider event id.
- Do not delete a license row on refund. Suspend it so the audit trail remains.
- Default activation budget is 2 machines. The module does not phone home unless an endpoint string is passed in.
